                                                "sense_id": "1831ad5e-7150-349b-b6e5-3df5635992cf",
                                                "text": "“Call me Zack Ransom.” “And I'm Gilbert Manhandle, literary dilettante with a gambling addiction.” “Nobody's going to remember that. You can be Zandy Billups.” “Fine. But I'm still a gambling addict.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
